                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Get the Gems, like the title said, collect all the gems in every level with various obstacles to beat the game.\n\n+Good concept and good level design.\n+Every levels give different challenges and very challenging.\n+5 Steam Trading Cards are available.\n+It's cheap, especially with discount coupon.\n\n-The sound really annoying for me.\n-The graphic could be better than current graphic.\n-Some stages are very hard, and to get the perfect game even more harder.\n\nWell if you like this kind of game, then you must try it. But actually this game isn't my type, so i don't like it.\nStill recommended: 5.5/10",
